[
  {"id":"child.scope","topic":"child","title":"资料适用范围","text":"以下儿童座椅资料仅对应 Volvo EC40 2026、英国市场手册（25w17）；其他车型、年款和地区必须查对应说明书，不能直接套用。","keywords":["儿童座椅","车型","年款","地区"],"warning":false,"source_url":"https://www.volvocars.com/static/support-content/pdfs/uk_en-GB_ec40_2026_UM_e72b2a6fe66160a8aaebfc86ce6c832c.pdf","page":143,"conditions":{"model":"EC40","year":2026,"market":"UK"}},
  {"id":"child.fit","topic":"child","title":"选择匹配的儿童约束系统","text":"安装前应核对儿童座椅与车辆、座位的适配表，并遵循车辆及儿童座椅说明书。ISOFIX 接口的存在不表示所有儿童座椅都兼容。","keywords":["儿童座椅","适配","安装","安全"],"warning":true,"source_url":"https://www.volvocars.com/uk/support/car/ec40/article/0ed816eed33d98cac0a8cc377bc12bc7-30eab915efda26f3c0a8b08a3ef5efb7-74a7ec5e0ebe50dec0a8b03c492bbebe/","conditions":{"model":"EC40","market":"UK"}},
  {"id":"child.rear_front","topic":"child","title":"副驾后向座椅与气囊","text":"本手册规定：后向儿童座椅装在前排副驾驶位置时，副驾驶安全气囊必须停用（关闭）；气囊启用时禁止这样安装。此条件不能省略。","keywords":["副驾","后向","反向","宝宝","婴儿","气囊","关闭"],"warning":true,"source_url":"https://www.volvocars.com/static/support-content/pdfs/uk_en-GB_ec40_2026_UM_e72b2a6fe66160a8aaebfc86ce6c832c.pdf","page":143,"conditions":{"position":"front_passenger","orientation":"rear_facing","model":"EC40","year":2026,"market":"UK"}},
  {"id":"child.forward_front","topic":"child","title":"副驾前向座椅与气囊","text":"本手册对前向儿童座椅装在前排副驾驶位置的要求是启用（开启）副驾驶安全气囊；不能把后向座椅的关闭规则套用到前向座椅。","keywords":["前向","正向","副驾","气囊","开启"],"warning":true,"source_url":"https://www.volvocars.com/static/support-content/pdfs/uk_en-GB_ec40_2026_UM_e72b2a6fe66160a8aaebfc86ce6c832c.pdf","page":143,"conditions":{"position":"front_passenger","orientation":"forward_facing","model":"EC40","year":2026,"market":"UK"}},
  {"id":"child.rear_seat","topic":"child","title":"后排安装的适用条件","text":"后排安装应按该座位的适配表和儿童座椅说明书操作；前排副驾后向安装的气囊关闭要求不直接适用于后排。","keywords":["后排","后座","儿童座椅","气囊"],"warning":true,"source_url":"https://www.volvocars.com/static/support-content/pdfs/uk_en-GB_ec40_2026_UM_e72b2a6fe66160a8aaebfc86ce6c832c.pdf","page":143,"conditions":{"position":"rear","model":"EC40","year":2026,"market":"UK"}},
  {"id":"child.isofix","topic":"child","title":"ISOFIX 位置与兼容性","text":"使用 ISOFIX 前先核对座位是否支持、儿童座椅尺寸等级及车辆兼容清单，再按双方说明书安装并检查锁止；不能假定每个座位都有 ISOFIX。","keywords":["ISOFIX","接口","固定","锁止","安装","中间座位"],"warning":true,"source_url":"https://www.volvocars.com/uk/support/car/ec40/article/0ed816eed33d98cac0a8cc377bc12bc7-30eab915efda26f3c0a8b08a3ef5efb7-74a7ec5e0ebe50dec0a8b03c492bbebe/","conditions":{"model":"EC40","market":"UK"}},
  {"id":"tire.cold","topic":"tire","title":"冷胎测量","text":"Volvo V60 所引手册要求按冷胎状态检查胎压；行驶后的热胎读数不能直接当作冷胎目标值。","keywords":["胎压","轮胎","冷胎","热胎"],"warning":true,"source_url":"https://www.volvocars.com/uk/support/car/v60/21w46/article/73e14f8cc7f8d151c0a81f6f7932e5d8_c16e2a6e902332cac0a8cc8a37f81057_5f824d179315b71cc0a801514c64175f/","conditions":{"model":"V60","market":"UK"}},
  {"id":"tire.label","topic":"tire","title":"胎压数值的依据","text":"正确胎压应查本车轮胎信息标签及适用载荷条件。当前未提供车辆标签，证据不足，不能编造统一的 bar 或 kPa 数值。","keywords":["胎压","多少","数值","载荷","标签","气压"],"warning":true,"source_url":"https://www.volvocars.com/uk/support/car/v60/21w46/article/73e14f8cc7f8d151c0a81f6f7932e5d8_c16e2a6e902332cac0a8cc8a37f81057_5f824d179315b71cc0a801514c64175f/","conditions":{"model":"V60","market":"UK"}},
  {"id":"coolant.hot","topic":"coolant","title":"热冷却液的压力危险","text":"Volvo V90 2020 手册警告：冷却液高温时禁止打开膨胀罐盖，热液和压力可能造成伤害。遇过热告警应先安全停车并遵循对应车辆告警指示，不给出无车型依据的加注量。","keywords":["过热","冷却液","水箱","防冻液","盖子","烫"],"warning":true,"source_url":"https://www.volvocars.com/uk/support/car/v90/2020/article/40dc9e577027f1e6c0a801510cbfb05a/","conditions":{"model":"V90","year":2020,"market":"UK"}},
  {"id":"charging.inspect","topic":"charging","title":"检查充电设备损坏","text":"Tesla Model Y 2020–2024 手册要求检查充电设备；电缆损坏或劣化时不得继续使用，应更换合适设备或联系服务支持。此处不提供自行维修高压部件的方法。","keywords":["充电","破损","损坏","线缆","电缆","充电枪"],"warning":true,"source_url":"https://www.tesla.com/ownersmanual/2020_2024_modely/en_us/GUID-9A3F0F72-71F4-433D-B68B-0A472A9359DF.html","conditions":{"model":"Model Y","years":"2020–2024","market":"US"}},
  {"id":"charging.wet","topic":"charging","title":"湿手与积水充电防护","text":"Kia 所引手册警告：不要用湿手接触充电连接器或插头，也不要站在水中连接充电电缆。先停止操作，遵循本车型与充电设备说明。","keywords":["湿手","积水","充电","插头","下雨"],"warning":true,"source_url":"https://ownersmanual.kia.com/full_webhelp/CV1/2023/en_US/topics/t00042.html","conditions":{"manual":"CV1/2023/en_US"}}
